  "description": "Konbami is a bold Japanese-style display font with a strong, expressive, and powerful character. Inspired by mystical Japanese culture, the world of samurai, and modern tribal aesthetics, this typeface is designed to deliver instant visual impact.\nFeaturing sharp, aggressive, and heavy letterforms, Japanese Konbami is perfect for:\n– Japanese-, samurai-, anime-, and fantasy-themed logos\n– Game titles and game branding\n– Posters, merchandise, and streetwear designs\n– YouTube thumbnails, esports branding, and album covers\n– Designs that demand a powerful, dark, and eye-catching presence\nKonbami is built for headlines and main titles — not for body text. That’s its strength. It creates focus, energy, and a strong visual identity at first glance.\nWhy Choose Konbami?\n– Bold and expressive Japanese-style typography\n– Strong visual impact for logos and titles\n– Ideal for fantasy, action, samurai, and game designs\n– Remains readable despite its extreme style\n– Makes your designs look bolder and more professional\nIf you’re looking for a Japanese font that’s not generic, not soft, and truly full of character, Japanese Konbami is the right visual weapon.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Konbami is a bold Japanese-style display font with a strong, expressive, and powerful character. Inspired by mystical Japanese culture, the world of samurai, and modern tribal aesthetics, this typeface is designed to deliver instant visual impact.</p>\n<p>Featuring sharp, aggressive, and heavy letterforms, Japanese Konbami is perfect for:<br>\n– Japanese-, samurai-, anime-, and fantasy-themed logos<br>\n– Game titles and game branding<br>\n– Posters, merchandise, and streetwear designs<br>\n– YouTube thumbnails, esports branding, and album covers<br>\n– Designs that demand a powerful, dark, and eye-catching presence</p>\n<p>Konbami is built for headlines and main titles — not for body text. That’s its strength. It creates focus, energy, and a strong visual identity at first glance.</p>\n<p>Why Choose Konbami?<br>\n– Bold and expressive Japanese-style typography<br>\n– Strong visual impact for logos and titles<br>\n– Ideal for fantasy, action, samurai, and game designs<br>\n– Remains readable despite its extreme style<br>\n– Makes your designs look bolder and more professional</p>\n<p>If you’re looking for a Japanese font that’s not generic, not soft, and truly full of character, Japanese Konbami is the right visual weapon.</p>",
